flowchart TB
    Trigger([Schedule or manual])
    Raw[(S3 - raw datasets)]
    Glue[AWS Glue ETL]
    Curated[(S3 - curated)]
    Golden[(S3 - golden eval set)]
    ETL[Run Glue job]
    Train[Train: SageMaker Training Job]
    Eval[Eval: SageMaker Processing Job]
    Compare{Better than incumbent?}
    Register[Register in Model Registry]
    Reject[Reject + emit alarm]
    MR[(SageMaker Model Registry)]
    MLF[MLflow tracking]

    Trigger --> ETL
    Raw --> ETL --> Curated
    Curated --> Train
    Train --> Eval
    Golden --> Eval
    Eval --> Compare
    Compare -->|yes| Register
    Compare -->|no| Reject
    Register --> MR
    Train --> MLF
    Eval --> MLF
